<title>USA: Leading Edge Earth names Moran president.</title>
<headline>Leading Edge Earth names Moran president.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading Edge Earth Products Inc said it named David Moran president and chief operating officer, replacing Grant Record, who remains chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Moran previously was senior vice president of product development with Champion Home Builders in Auburn Hill, Michigan.</p>
